      "title": "A Special Kind of Cafe",
      "text": "In many cities, cat cafes are becoming very popular. These are places where people can enjoy a cup of coffee while spending time with cats. The idea started in Asia, but now you can find them all over the world. When you enter, the first thing you (1) _____ is how relaxed the atmosphere is. The cats usually walk around freely, and customers are (2) _____ to pet them if the animals are willing. However, there are rules to ensure the cats stay happy. For example, you should not pick them up or wake them if they are sleeping. Many of the cats in these cafes (3) _____ from local shelters, which means that visiting helps these animals find a new home. It is a great way to (4) _____ time if you love animals but cannot have a pet at home. Even if you are not a cat person, the coffee is usually excellent. It is (5) _____ to check the cafe's website before you go, as some places require you to book a table in advance. It is definitely an (6) _____ experience for everyone involved.",
